### 1. Cadastrar 1° usuario
POST http://localhost:3000/cliente
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nome": "Jose",
    "email": "Jose@gmail.com",
    "senha": "123",
    "cpf": "12345678912",
    "endereco": "Rua 1, 123",
    "telefone": "48999998888"
}

### 2. Cadastrar 2° usuario
POST http://localhost:3000/cliente
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nome": "Marcos",
    "email": "Marcos@gmail.com",
    "senha": "123",
    "cpf": "98765432100",
    "endereco": "Rua 2, 456",
    "telefone": "48988887777"
}

### 3. Login Jose
# @name loginReq
POST http://localhost:3000/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "Jose@gmail.com",
    "senha": "123"
}

### 4. Rota privada SEM token (esperado: 401 Acesso negado!)
GET http://localhost:3000/cliente/Jose

### 5. Buscar por nome (esperado: 200)
GET http://localhost:3000/cliente/Jose
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

### 6. Atualizar cliente (esperado: 200)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/cliente/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

{
    "codCliente": 1,
    "nome": "Jose Silva",
    "email": "Jose@gmail.com",
    "senha": "123",
    "cpf": "12345678912",
    "endereco": "Rua 1, 123",
    "telefone": "48999998888"
}

### 7. Cadastrar veiculo (esperado: 201)
POST http://localhost:3000/veiculo
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

{
    "modelo": "modelo1",
    "marca": "marca1",
    "placa": "1234",
    "codigoRastreador": "1234",
    "idCliente": 1
}

### 8. Login Marcos
# @name loginReq
POST http://localhost:3000/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "Marcos@gmail.com",
    "senha": "123"
}

### 9. Apagar cliente (esperado: 200)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/cliente/2
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

### 10. Cadastrar agendamento (esperado: 201)
POST http://localhost:3000/agendamento
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

{
    "data": "2026-10-25",
    "horario": "14:30:00",
    "servico": "instalação",
    "idVeiculo": 1,
    "idCliente": 1
}

### 11. Agendamento com cliente inexistente (esperado: 404)
POST http://localhost:3000/agendamento
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

{
    "data": "2026-10-25",
    "horario": "14:30:00",
    "servico": "instalação",
    "idVeiculo": 1,
    "idCliente": 999
}

### 12. Listar agendamentos (esperado: 200)
GET http://localhost:3000/agendamentos
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

### 13. Atualizar horario (esperado: 200)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/agendamento/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

{
    "horario": "16:00:00"
}